@startuml UML状态图_报名记录
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam StateBorderColor #4A5568
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam noteBorderColor #4A5568

state "已购票" as PURCHASED
state "已检票" as CHECKED_IN
state "正常结束" as NORMAL_END
state "自行取消" as SELF_CANCELLED
state "未检票" as NO_SHOW
state "活动取消" as ACTIVITY_CANCELLED

[*] --> PURCHASED : 报名成功（已支付）
PURCHASED --> CHECKED_IN : 检票通过
CHECKED_IN --> NORMAL_END : 场次时间结束
PURCHASED --> SELF_CANCELLED : 参与者退票\n或管理员强制退票
PURCHASED --> NO_SHOW : 场次结束未检票
PURCHASED --> ACTIVITY_CANCELLED : 活动取消（退款）
CHECKED_IN --> ACTIVITY_CANCELLED : 活动取消（退款）

NORMAL_END --> [*]
SELF_CANCELLED --> [*]
NO_SHOW --> [*]
ACTIVITY_CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of SELF_CANCELLED
  参与者退票需未过退票截止；
  管理员强制退票按 REQ-048 处理。
end note

note bottom of NO_SHOW
  缺席不释放名额；
  不另行记录缺席原因。
end note

legend bottom
  终态：正常结束、自行取消、未检票、活动取消；终态不可再变更。
  已购票、已检票、未检票占用名额；自行取消、退票、活动取消释放名额；缺席不释放名额。
  活动取消时，已购票和已检票记录都进入“活动取消”并退款。
endlegend
@enduml
